### Walk-Forward Design
- Expanding window: train grows each fold, test = 1 month
- 8 folds on SPY: Apr 2024 → Mar 2025
- Exact timestamp slicing (no normalize — avoids uneven fold issue)
- shift(1) applied at compute time only — never saved to parquet
- Lookahead assertion check on every fold — all passed
- 3 target horizons: fwd_ret_1m, fwd_ret_5m, fwd_ret_10m

