| Horizon     | Mean IC   | ICIR   |
|-------------|-----------|--------|
| fwd_ret_1m  | -0.004817 | -0.545 |
| fwd_ret_5m  | -0.011172 | -0.836 |
| fwd_ret_10m | -0.014242 | -0.667 |

### Honest Interpretation
- OFI shows negative IC at all horizons — mean reversion effect
- At 10s bar resolution, buy pressure gets absorbed and price reverts
- Negative IC is still tradeable — just go opposite direction
- Phase 3 showed positive contemporaneous IC — shift(1) here gives true predictive IC
- realized_vol and amihud positive IC — illiquidity predicts upward returns
- microprice strongest consistent signal (ICIR -2.664)

